<p id="mwCA"><i id="mwCQ"><b id="mwCg">Cryptoblepharus pulcher</b></i>, the <b id="mwCw">elegant snake-eyed skink</b>, is a species of lizard in the family <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Scincidae" title="Scincidae" class="mw-redirect" id="mwDA">Scincidae</a>. It is <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Endemism" title="Endemism" id="mwDQ">endemic</a> to southern and eastern <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Australia" title="Australia" id="mwDg">Australia</a>.<sup about="#mwt9" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-iucn_status_18_November_2021_1-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"iucn status 18 November 2021"}}'><a href="./Cryptoblepharus_pulcher#cite_note-iucn_status_18_November_2021-1" id="mwDw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEQ">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEg">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt10" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-RDB_2-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"RDB"}}'><a href="./Cryptoblepharus_pulcher#cite_note-RDB-2" id="mwEw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFQ">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

